# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# kusa — what may and may not be published.
#
# The KurdiSent corpus (Badawi et al., 2025) is a separate work under its own
# terms and is NOT redistributed here. The rule below is deliberately strict:
# text-bearing paths are excluded wholesale and the few safe, text-free
# artefacts are re-included by name. Adding a new file under splits/, datasets/
# or annotation/ therefore requires an explicit exception — the default is
# "not published". Do not relax this without re-checking the corpus licence.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python / Jupyter ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# --- OS / editor / Google Drive sync ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
*:Zone.Identifier
*.tmp
.tmp.drive*
~$*

# --- Secrets / local environment ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials*.json
token*.json

# --- KurdiSent corpus & every derived FULL-TEXT file (NOT redistributed) ---
# Obtain the corpus separately and regenerate these locally; see datasets/README.md.
datasets/*.csv
datasets/*.tsv
datasets/*.txt
datasets/*.parquet
datasets/*.jsonl

# splits/: deny by default, allow only the text-free files by name.
splits/*.csv
splits/*.txt
splits/*.jsonl
# dev_folds.csv is a row_id -> fold map (integers only);
# split_distribution.csv is label x category counts per split.
!splits/dev_folds.csv
!splits/split_distribution.csv

# --- Blind re-annotation: gold keys and everything carrying corpus text ---
# The round exports/imports and the merged label tables all embed the sentences
# the annotators saw, so the whole round directories stay local. Only the
# aggregate agreement statistics are published.
*_PRIVATE.csv
*private*.csv
annotation/round1/
annotation/round2/
annotation/round*/
annotation/*.csv
# Aggregate kappa / PABAK statistics only, no items and no text.
!annotation/agreement_summary_both_rounds.csv
# Per-item labels WITHOUT the sentences: identifiers, arm membership, gold label
# and the two annotators' labels, all from a closed vocabulary. Regenerate with
# annotation/make_public_labels.py, which asserts that nothing else gets out.
!annotation/round1_labels_public.csv

# --- Text-bearing analysis exports (regenerate by running the notebooks) ---
*_misclassified.csv
oof_surface_weights.csv

# --- Model checkpoints (large; produced by the CV notebooks) ---
*.pth
*.pt
*.bin
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
final_models/
